[27.986469, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b]2;yoloctl — ✳ leogr\\coordinator: Claude box weekly quota\u0007\u001b[7;15r\u001b[7;1H\u001b[3T\u001b[1;32r\u001b[2;27H\u001b[38;5;215;1mClaude box weekly\u001b[m\r\n  account's quota, not a separate one for the new box.\r\n  Usage in either box counts against it. I closed the usage\r\n  screen afterwards, so the session is back at its prompt.\r\n  To work in it directly, run \u001b[38;5;153myoloctl box attach dev2\u001b[m.\n\u001b[6C\u001b[38;5;215m│\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;246mChurned for 43s · done 3:02 PM · 1 monitor still running\u001b[m  \u001b[38;5;215m│\u001b[m\n\b\u001b[38;5;215m│\u001b[38;5;246;48;5;237m❯ \u001b[38;5;231mList three files in this repo\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\u001b[11;64H\u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[m\u001b[12;62H\u001b[K\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[m Here are the first three files Git tracks in this repo:\u001b[14;64H\u001b[K\n- \u001b[38;5;153m.gitattributes\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;246mRan \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[m\u001b[23X\u001b[17;60H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[m 1. \u001b[1mFirst prompt:\u001b[m dev ran one shell command and listed     \n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;153m.gitattributes\u001b[m, \u001b[38;5;153m.github/workflows/ci.yml\u001b[m and  \n\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;153m.github/workflows/release.yml\u001b[m, then showed \"Baked for\n\u001b[6G4s\".      \r\n  2. \u001b[38;5;153;1m/compact\u001b[39m:\u001b[m dev showed \"⎿ Compacted (ctrl+o to see full\n\u001b[5G\u001b[1K summary)\" and went back to an empty prompt.\u001b[24;60H\u001b[1K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;246mWorked for 31s · done 3:03 PM · 1 monitor still running\u001b[m\r\n\n\n❯  \u001b[32;25H\u001b[38;5;235;48;5;215;1mClaude box weekly quota \u001b[22m  \u001b[m\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
